  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UKR P&#xe5;fyllnad EBRD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UKR Replenishment EBRD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EBRD startar upp en facilitet best&#xe5;ende av kreditlinor till lokala banker i Ukraina, vilka i sin tur st&#xe4;ller ut l&#xe5;n till mindre energieffektiviseringsprojekt inom s&#xe5;v&#xe4;l industrin som bostadssektorn. &#xc4;ven f&#xf6;rnybara energik&#xe4;llor kan komma ifr&#xe5;ga. Volymen p&#xe5; faciliteten planeras till 100 MEURO, vilket ber&#xe4;knas kr&#xe4;va 5 MEURO i tekniskt bist&#xe5;nd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD starts up a facility for onlending to local banks in Ukraine, which in their turn lend to small energy efficiency projects within both the industrial and residential sectors. The facility includes also renewable energy sources. The planned volume for it is 100 MEURO, for which an estimated 5 MEURO will be needed as technical assistance provided as grants from interested donors.</narrative>
  </description>
